note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note test_visor_semantic.om: Omega Visor V1 lane 1, read-only semantic API tests.
note Faithful pure seeded OM-2 port of tests/visor/test_visor_semantic.c: the same 95
note checks in the same order; a failing check prints the C check it ports.
note The second graph m of the C test is built in the one OM store after a full
note snapshot of g, and g is restored from that snapshot afterwards.
om2

